diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 1e7135b..7f5566c 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- vendor_a: when an order appears more than once in a file, the last row (the correction) is now loaded instead of the first. The row is posted at the position of its last occurrence. Other vendors still keep the first row.
 - Added vendor_c reader (`orderNumber`, `productCode`, `totalPrice`, `orderedAt` with UTC offset). Loading vendor_c to the warehouse is blocked until finance confirms whether `totalPrice` includes VAT.
 - Faster loads of large files: vendor_a/vendor_b timestamp parsing and row hashing take roughly 40% less CPU per row. Output and `row_hash` values are unchanged.
 - Loads reuse one warehouse connection for all chunks instead of opening a new HTTPS connection per 2,000 rows. If a proxy is configured, requests still go through urllib.
